CompileTimeError: d139_a_chain_both_ways_is_refused.jern:3:21, line 3 column 21
 3 |     println((1 < $x > 0) as String)
   |                     ^
 what: this chain of comparisons points both ways; group with `( )`
 why:  comparisons chain only when they all point the same way, and `==` and `!=` never chain (D139, standard 4.1)
